    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akitoodiunet a Akai a ŋina kitete a ŋina ka Akuj",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan eyakae isua nakwapin, torae apaki ŋin akisyakinet a ekaru a ŋol, ŋirwa a elap ŋitomon, toris ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon kelunyar ameun apaki ŋina enyasunere Yerusalem, abu apedor ŋina ke Ekapolon min neni kaŋ, okoyau ayoŋ neni sek ayai Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakitoodianakineta a ŋuna ka Akuj aŋuna abu ayoŋ eŋolik, abu Akuj okoya ayoŋ nakwap a Isirael, ekewuak ayoŋ lomoru ŋolo aoyan, ŋolo aya ŋaduketa ŋuna asibito ŋuna a etaun lowae keŋ ŋolo alo Kwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akayauni ayoŋ Ekapolon nen, abu ayoŋ eŋolik ekile a nen ŋolo amilimili ikwa eburonis, awoi iŋes alopuke, ayakar nakan keŋ ausi ŋina amilimilan ka eoot ŋolokipimet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol tema neni kaŋ, “Lokoku a ituŋanan, kiŋolik ejok ediyediye ka topupok ejok nooi, yau ŋatameta kon neni a ibore a daadaŋ a ŋini alosi ayoŋ akitoodikin iyoŋ, anerae aponi iyoŋ ikiyaun ne, ikotere eketoodikini ayoŋ iyoŋ ibore daadaŋ. Emaikina iyoŋ tolimok Ŋisirael ibore daadaŋ ŋini iŋolikini iyoŋ a ne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ŋin, abu ayoŋ eŋolik arwatata iryamit akibois ŋina ayai Akai ka Akuj. Arae aoyau a eoot a ŋolokipimet a ŋolo ayai nakan a ekile a ŋol ŋimitae ŋiuni. Abu ekile ŋol kipim arwatata, toryamu aoyau alokwap tari kidiama erae ŋimitae ŋiuni ka toryamu abutur a arwatata erae ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol tolot lopuke ŋolo iŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kide, todoka anadoketa a epuke a ŋol, kipim nenilapat a epuke a ŋol ameun alokidiama tari kwap, toryamu erae ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaaye epuke ŋol, ayai neni apedoryo akitor, ayakasi nen ŋagulei ŋauni a ŋolowae a epuke. Eriyan ŋagulei ŋun alowaetin a daadaŋ, arae aoyau ŋimitae ŋiuniuni. Arae abutur a ŋarwatatain a ŋuna atyakatyakato ŋagulei ŋun ŋimitae ŋiarei ka atutubet. Yaaye ŋagulei ŋuna eteere epuke ŋun, ayai neni apedoryo akitor, neni arae aoyau ŋimitae ŋiuni, amyaarit nen tari nagule ŋina eteosi ka Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ipimi ekile ŋol aoyau ameun alo Kai ka Akuj tari nagule ŋina ayai lopuke, abu toryamu arae ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani ipimi ekile ŋol agule ŋina ayai lopuke, toryamu aoyau ka arwatata erae ŋimitae ŋiomwon ka ŋipirin keŋ erae abutur emita epei. Ayai agule ŋina ke epuke ŋin lowae ŋolo alotooma epuke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋagulei ŋauni ŋolowae a epuke a ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kide, eriyan ŋagulei ŋun ciribib ka eriyan ŋipirin a ŋagulei a ŋun daadaŋ alokiŋaren ka alokaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol kipim epuke ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce, toryamu aoyau erae ŋimitae ŋikan, toryamu aoyau a epuke ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce erae ŋimitae ŋikanikapei ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai kiŋaren ŋinagule arwatata ŋina arae aoyau alokwap tari kidiama atutubet ŋina a emita. Eriyan ŋiwaetin a ŋagulei a daadaŋ, area ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol kipim aoyau a epuke ameun anarwatata a agule a ŋina alokiŋa epuke tari narwatata a agule a ŋina alotooma epuke; toryamu aoyau ameun a epeiwae tari ŋoloce erae ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ ekile ŋol kipim agule ŋina ayai lopuke, toryamu erae ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ka atutubet. Kipim daŋ iŋes ŋipirin ŋulu arekina nalapatui ŋuna aya kiŋa ka tooma epuke ŋol, toryamu erae ŋimitae ŋiuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae aoyau ameun alopuke alowae a ŋolo alotooma tari nakisalet a agule a ŋina ayai neni ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi narwatatain ŋuna alokiŋa ŋidirisae ŋulucicik a ŋinagule ka ayakasi daŋ narwatatain ŋuna atyakito ŋagulei. Ecianakinitae narwatatain ŋuna alotooma epuke ŋitorubei ŋulu a ŋikito a ŋiŋolya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoya ayoŋ nalapatu ŋina ayai kiŋa; abu ayoŋ eŋolik a nen ŋagulei ŋatomoniuni ŋuna adukonokinitae narwatata alokiŋa, kiŋaren ŋagulei ŋun, ayai akibois ŋina enaminamitae ŋamoru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amekinit akibois ŋin alapatu daadaŋ alokiŋaren ŋipukei a ŋagulei, ido eriyan aoyau a ŋolopuke ka neni enaminamitae ŋamoru. Atikiyoro kwap iwadio akibois ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol kipim aoyau akibois a ŋin ameun alotooma epuke ŋolo atikiyoro kwap tari kiŋa alapatu ŋina alotooma; arae aoyau ŋimitae ŋatomonikan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nabo ekile ŋol kipim aoyau a ŋiwaetin a epuke a ŋolo a alapatu a ŋina alokiŋa a ŋina eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kuju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋolowae a epuke a ŋol ŋagulei ŋauni ŋuna eteere epuke ŋol; eriyan ciribib ŋarwatatain ŋuna aya kidiŋ kec ka eriyan agule ŋina ayai lopuke ŋol ka ŋina ayai lopuke ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kide. Arae aoyau a epuke alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan ka aoyau a epeiwae tari ŋoloce arae ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan agule ŋina ayai lopuke ŋol ka ŋina ayai lopuke ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kide, ŋidirisae ka ŋitorubei a ŋiŋolya daŋ, ekwaan ka ŋulu aya lopuke ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kide. Ayakasi lopukei ŋul ŋadoketa ŋakanikaarei ka ayai agule a epuke a ŋol lowae ŋolo alotooma arwatata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai epuke nalapatu ŋina alotooma ŋolo eŋoliyarit Kuju, lowae ŋolo ayai epuke ŋolo alo Kuju, lopite ŋolopei ayakar tari ŋolo eŋoliyarit Kide lowae ŋolo ayai epuke ŋolo alo Kide. Abu ekile ŋol kipim ameun alopuke ke epei tari lopuke ŋolo eteosi ka ŋol, toryamu aoyau erae ŋimitae ŋatomonikan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoriko ayoŋ lowae ŋolo alo Kwap Akai ka Akuj; abu ayoŋ eŋolik a nen epuke ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kwap. Abu ekile ŋol kipim ŋipirin a epuke a ŋol ka agule ŋina ayai lopuke ŋol, toryamu eriyan ŋimitae ka ŋulu a aris iŋes epim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
