              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi ŋidirisae nagulei ŋuna ayakasi lopuke ŋol lopite ŋolopei ayakatar nagulei a ŋipukei a ŋuluce daŋ. Arae aoyau a epuke a ŋol ameun alosepyon ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan ka arae aoyau a epeiwae tari lowae ŋoloce ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi lopuke ŋol ŋadoketa ŋakanikaarei ka ayai agule a epuke a ŋol lowae ŋolo alotooma arwatata. Ayakasi lopirin a epuke a ŋol ŋitorubei a ŋiŋolya, aŋolowae a epuke a ŋol, ayai etorube epei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai epuke a alapatu a ŋina alotooma epuke lowae ŋolo alo Kwap, ameun alopuke a ŋol tari lopuke ŋolo elomarere kiŋa alowae a ŋolo alo Kwap, arae aoyau ŋimitae ŋatomonikan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
