        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoya ayoŋ nalapatu ŋina alotooma Akai ka Akuj, ayai alapatu ŋin diyete epuke ŋolo ayai lowae ŋolo alo Kwap, abu iŋes kipim epuke ŋol toryamu eriyan ka ŋuluce. ",
          "type": "text",
