          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epimitae ŋagulei ŋuna eteere epuke ŋol, kaapei ka agule ŋina ayai lopuke ŋol eriyan ka ŋuna a ŋipukei a ŋuluce. Epimitae ŋipirin ŋulu ayakasi lopuke ŋol eriyan ka ŋulu ayakasi lopukei ŋuluce. Ayakasi lopuke ŋol ka nagule ŋina ayai nen ŋidirisae ŋiwaetin daadaŋ; arae aoyau a epuke a ŋol ameun alokwap tari kidiama ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan ka ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce, arae ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
