              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakasi lopukei daadaŋ ŋulu ka alapatu a ŋina alotooma ŋagulei ŋuna arae aoyau ameun alokwap tari kidiama ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan torae aoyau anawaetin ŋimitae ŋiarei ka atutubet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
