              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋoliyarit agule a epuke aŋol nalapatu ŋina alokiŋa, ayakasi ŋitorubei a ŋiŋolya lopirin agule a ŋin ka ayakasi ŋadoketa ŋakanikauni lopuke ŋol.",
