        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol okoya ayoŋ nalapatu ŋina ayai tooma epuke ŋolo ayai lowae ŋolo alo Kide, abu iŋes kipim epuke ŋol; epimitae epuke ŋol iriyan ka ŋuluce. ",
