        {
          "text": "Epimitae ŋagulei ŋuna eteere epuke ŋol kaapei ka agule ŋina ayai lopuke ŋol eriyan ka ŋuna aŋipukei a ŋuluce. Epimitae ŋipirin ŋulu ayakasi lopuke ŋol eriyan ka ŋulu ayakasi lopukei ŋuluce. Ayakasi lopuke ŋol ka nagule ŋina ayai nen ŋidirisae ŋiwaetin daadaŋ; arae aoyau a epuke a ŋol ameun alokwap tari kidiama ŋimitae ŋatomoniarei ka ŋikan ka ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce arae ŋimitae ŋitomon ka ŋiarei ka atutubet. ",
