        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol okoya ayoŋ lopuke ŋolo ayai lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, abu ekile ŋol kipim epuke ŋol, epimitae eriyan ka ŋipukei ŋuluce. ",
