          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eŋoliyarit agule a epuke a ŋol nalapatu ŋina alokiŋa, ayakasi ŋitorubei a ŋiŋolya lopirin agule a ŋin a ŋolowae ka ayakasi ŋadoketa ŋakanikauni lopuke ŋol. ",
          "type": "text",
