        {
          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoyau ayoŋ nalapatu ŋina alotooma Akai ka Akuj. Ayakasi nalapatu ŋin ŋagulei ŋaarei ŋuna aŋaara, eŋoliyarit apei lowae ŋolo alo Kwap alodiyete epuke ŋolo alo Kuju, eŋoliyarit ŋinace lowae ŋolo a epuke a ŋolo alo Kide a ŋolo eŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kuju. ",
          "type": "text",
