          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tosodi agule ŋina iŋoliyarit lowae ŋolo alo Kuju, erae ŋina a ŋisacaradotin a ŋulu erae etic kec akiyok namuroet. Erae ŋisacaradotin ŋul ŋidwe a Sadok ŋulusapa ŋulu erae ikes bon ecamakinitae aloletok a Lepi aponare akitiya etic alokiŋaren Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
