        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ekile ŋol kipim alapatu ŋina alotooma ŋin, toryamu eriyan ŋiwaetin daadaŋ erae ŋimitae ŋatomonikan. Ayai Akai ka Akuj To alapatu ŋin ka ayai namuroet kiŋaren Akai ka Akuj.",
          "type": "text",
