          "text": "Abu nai ekile ŋol okoya ayoŋ nagule ŋina elomarere Kai ka Akuj ka abu iŋes kipim ŋipirin ŋulu a agule a ŋin, toryamu erae aoyau kec alowaetin a agule a daadaŋ ŋimitae ŋiarei ka atutubet; toryamu epuke a agule a ŋin erae ŋimitae ŋikanikaarei ameun alowae ke epei tari ŋoloce ka ŋarwatatain a epuke a ŋol erae abutur emita ka atutubet alowaetin a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
