          "text": "Arae aoyau a agule a ŋin alosepyon ŋimitae ŋitomon ka arae anakou ka neni iteotor ŋimitae ŋikanikapei. Adokio a ŋadoketa elosyo nagule ŋin ka ayakasi ŋipirin ŋiarei lopuke a agule a ŋin, epeiwae epuke.",
